<title>UK: Basel Kantonalbank sets warrants on ESEC Holding.</title>
<headline>Basel Kantonalbank sets warrants on ESEC Holding.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Basel Kantonalbank, Basel says it has issued two million American-style call warrants, on ESEC Holding SA.</p>
<p>100 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    6000.00 SFR	     PREMIUM	19.10 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.00 SFR		  GEARING	11 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.DEC.96-19.MAY.98   PAYDATE	03.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
